### REST Client — S8.P2 Práctica GitHub Actions + publish profile.
### Parser del XML + workflow YAML + recomendador auth.

@host = http://localhost:5112

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health

### Parsear publish profile correcto (MSDeploy + FTP, password real)
POST {{host}}/ghactions/profile/parsear
Content-Type: application/json

{ "xml": "<publishData><publishProfile profileName=\"app - Web Deploy\" publishMethod=\"MSDeploy\" publishUrl=\"app.scm.azurewebsites.net:443\" userName=\"$app\" userPWD=\"abc123XYZsecreto\" destinationAppUrl=\"https://app.azurewebsites.net\" /><publishProfile profileName=\"app - FTP\" publishMethod=\"FTP\" publishUrl=\"ftps://...\" userName=\"$app\" userPWD=\"abc123XYZsecreto\" destinationAppUrl=\"https://app.azurewebsites.net\" /></publishData>" }

### Parsear publish profile con password placeholder (anti-pattern)
POST {{host}}/ghactions/profile/parsear
Content-Type: application/json

{ "xml": "<publishData><publishProfile profileName=\"app - Web Deploy\" publishMethod=\"MSDeploy\" publishUrl=\"app.scm.azurewebsites.net:443\" userName=\"$app\" userPWD=\"<password-larguisima>\" destinationAppUrl=\"https://app.azurewebsites.net\" /></publishData>" }

### Workflow minimal (1 job, push a main)
POST {{host}}/ghactions/workflow
Content-Type: application/json

{ "appName": "webapp-cicd-pedro", "dotnetVersion": "10.0.x" }

### Workflow con tests (2 jobs: build-test → deploy)
POST {{host}}/ghactions/workflow
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appName": "webapp-cicd-pedro",
  "dotnetVersion": "10.0.x",
  "incluirTests": true,
  "smokeAlFinal": true
}

### Workflow solo en tags + Environment producción
POST {{host}}/ghactions/workflow
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appName": "webapp-cicd-pedro",
  "dotnetVersion": "10.0.x",
  "soloEnTags": true,
  "environmentProduccion": true,
  "incluirTests": true
}

### Recomendar auth: side project personal → Publish Profile
POST {{host}}/ghactions/auth/recomendar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sideProjectPersonal": true }

### Recomendar auth: producción + auditoría + Entra controlado → OIDC
POST {{host}}/ghactions/auth/recomendar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sideProjectPersonal": false,
  "controlaEntraId": true,
  "proyectoEnProduccion": true,
  "auditoriaRequerida": true,
  "multiEnvironment": true,
  "equipoGrande": true
}

### Plan + checklist completo
POST {{host}}/ghactions/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publishProfileXml": "<publishData><publishProfile profileName=\"app - Web Deploy\" publishMethod=\"MSDeploy\" publishUrl=\"app.scm.azurewebsites.net:443\" userName=\"$app\" userPWD=\"realpwd123\" destinationAppUrl=\"https://app.azurewebsites.net\" /></publishData>",
  "opciones": { "appName": "webapp-cicd-pedro", "incluirTests": true, "smokeAlFinal": true },
  "escenario": { "sideProjectPersonal": true }
}
